hing her father reiterates to her  the grandfather would cherish what  you've done the grandfather here likely  refers to kier egan the founder of lumen  and fun fact the name kier derives from  gaelic meaning the dark one helena  ironically means shining light in greek  while heli literally means hellish check  out this shot here where we can see the  word hell clearly made out i guess it  makes sense then that the first image we  see of helly is of her on a  coffin-shaped table in an episode titled  good news about hell speaking of  helena's father i should also mention  that those who attend the break room  often recount hearing something in the  background while reciting the  compunction statement that weird apology  thing helly recites into the mirror  dylan says that when he's in the break  room he's heard a baby crying which  could be one of his two other children  if milk chick is to believe that dylan  has three kids helly however heard the  sound of a mumbling angry man could that  person be her father in her brief  interaction in the outside world were  also reintroduced to gabby and angelo  arteta gabby was the woman devin met who  underwent severance so she wouldn't have  to live through the pain of giving birth  her husband is a pro-severant senator so  it makes sense that someone like helena  and the eagans would want to be close to  people in positions of power in helly's  final moments as her audi she proclaims  to everyone at the egan family gala that  everything they know about severance is  a lie and that the innies are being  tortured now this may seem like a deeply  calamitous event but keep in mind this  is a private friends and family of the  egan's event this little blip can be  easily covered up plus if anything does  leak to the media it's likely to be  suppressed as lumen seems to have  insiders in all aspects of the media on  march 18th apple released a companion  book to the tv series called severance  the lexington letter i'll leave a 